LeaderUsesSameWorkflowBoundary exercises ExecuteCardDerivedSession.
LeaderUsesSameWorkflowBoundary has completeness = closed.
LeaderUsesSameWorkflowBoundary illustrates SessionWorkflowDelivery.
LeaderUsesSameWorkflowBoundary runs-in RoutineHandling.
LeaderUsesSameWorkflowBoundary step 1 sends RequestWorkflowChange from ExternalLeaderMcp to SessionCoordinator via WorkflowCommands.
LeaderUsesSameWorkflowBoundary step 2 sends WorkflowBlocked from SessionCoordinator to ExternalLeaderMcp via WorkflowCommands reply-to 1.
OwnerReconcilesExistingAttempt exercises ResumeSessionWithoutLeader.
OwnerReconcilesExistingAttempt has completeness = closed.
OwnerReconcilesExistingAttempt illustrates SessionWorkflowDelivery.
OwnerReconcilesExistingAttempt runs-in RoutineHandling.
OwnerReconcilesExistingAttempt step 1 sends RequestWorkflowChange from ExternalOwnerCli to SessionCoordinator via WorkflowCommands.
OwnerReconcilesExistingAttempt step 2 sends RequestHostContinuation from SessionCoordinator to HostActionGateway via HostActions.
OwnerReconcilesExistingAttempt step 3 sends HostAttemptObserved from HostActionGateway to SessionCoordinator via HostActions reply-to 2.
OwnerReconcilesExistingAttempt step 4 sends WorkflowAdvanced from SessionCoordinator to ExternalOwnerCli via WorkflowCommands reply-to 1.
