OwnerRecoveryDetectsRecordConflict step 3 sends RecordsConflicted from CanonicalEffectPublisher to SessionCoordinator via CanonicalEffects reply-to 2.
OwnerRecoveryDetectsRecordConflict step 4 sends WorkflowBlocked from SessionCoordinator to ExternalOwnerCli via WorkflowCommands reply-to 1.
