OwnerStartsAfterRecordsCommit step 5 sends HostAttemptObserved from HostActionGateway to SessionCoordinator via HostActions reply-to 4.
OwnerStartsAfterRecordsCommit step 6 sends WorkflowAdvanced from SessionCoordinator to ExternalOwnerCli via WorkflowCommands reply-to 1.
